                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "Just tried the game for a couple minutes and so far it's fairly solid!\n\nIt plays as one of those games where you go forward to the beat of a song and must avoid obstacles.\nIt is fairly hard but never unfair: obstacles are well telegraphed. Every time I lost it was because of my mistake or the speed, not because I couldn't have seen the obstacle.\n\nOnly little downsides so far:\n- no way to quit with the gamepad AFAICT (Esc works)\n- the white/blue world is very bright, the shifting between world changes contrast a lot and is hard on the eyes",
